  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c715baaf2916c059deb/step-deb1cb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms and tomato, stirring occasionally, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add herb & mushroom seasoning and garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c715baaf2916c059deb/step-884f3710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the boiling water(see ingredients), orecchiette, light cooking creamand stock concentrate. Stir to combine and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cover with a lid. Cook, stirring occasionally, until the pasta is ‘al dente’, 11 minutes.\n• Once the pasta is cooked, stir in baby spinach leaves, basil pesto and Parmesan cheese. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c715baaf2916c059deb/step-a96ea620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide one-pot creamy pesto and mushroom orecchiette between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c715baaf2916c059deb/step-2ccddd30.jpg"
    }
  ]
